Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.42,0:00:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 小德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Dwighty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.29,0:00:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta say,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is damn good having you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情必须完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, things gotta get done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.05,0:01:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一流的手下助我获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need my top guys ‭out in front acing that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你死里逃生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had yourself a close call, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遭到了埋伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got ambushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,中了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.65,0:01:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人没能逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest didn't walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, until…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到了森林 继续前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to the woods, kept going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朝山顶寨走去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I headed toward Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想着我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured our people would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早会封锁那片地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}putting up a blockade sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.09,0:01:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们解除了封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we pulled the blockade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,得让老鼠玩一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have to let the mice play a little,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人得分清轻重缓急\N{\fnArial\fs30}our people need ‭to get their business in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:01:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你喝杯啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why don't you just slug a beer,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上最好的背心 下楼去\N{\fnArial\fs30}put on your best vest, and get your ass downstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为像我所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause like I said…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有事情要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we got work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get 'em good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.94,0:02:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,溅出来也没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right if they spill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要收集起来以备后用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna gather up the jackpots for refreshers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.69,0:02:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,内脏就是内脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and guts is guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,深深地搅一搅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push it in nice and deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会非常棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be all kinds of awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等山顶寨尝到我们的苦头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the Hilltop just feels the tip of what we are packin'…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会立马跪下屈服\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they are gonna drop to their knees lickety-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:03:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的重点是吓唬这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today is about scaring these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不要打头 皮肉伤即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going for head shots, just flesh wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.10,0:03:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤一些人 让他们活着 变成行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit a few, leave 'em livin', let 'em turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't kill 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.48,0:03:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}D.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根自己开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan's handling his own transport,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以跟我坐一辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can ride with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算侦察一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm gonna scout ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看前方有没有敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if anything's coming our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得很细致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, considerate thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们有侦察队在侦察 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we got scouts scouting, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起你来更可牺牲的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far more expendable soldiers than you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说你可牺牲 完全不是这意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is not to say ‭you're expendable … at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 跟我坐一辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, ride with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我路上给你讲讲计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}we make sure ‭you're up to speed on the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.10,0:04:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是尼根的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what Negan wants,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我们为什么还在唠叨\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I don't know why we're still jawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么 我们就做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真美 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look beautiful, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:16.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.27,0:07:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我环顾四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look around and…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.81,0:07:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,想到了那些逝去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think about the people that are gone…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,和还在这里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the people that are still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.07,0:08:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it ain't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, about…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在救世堂的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I did at Sanctuary,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.09,0:08:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图迅速地结束一切…\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to end it real quick…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想做个了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再给他们一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want ‭to give them another chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再给了\N{\fnArial\fs30}not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时根本没在乎有谁在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't care who was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这样是不是对的 还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know ‭if that makes it right or …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.77,0:08:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时不想错杀无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to risk killing innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本该只考虑我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've just been worrying about our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell with anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会继续抗争…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll keep fighting …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.41,0:08:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬在外面设了警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's got lookouts out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,八百米一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every half-mile,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.07,0:08:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,相互传送信号 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting to signal each other, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我也准备去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去确保我们所有人都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make sure we're all ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要尽可能多覆盖一些范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're covering as much ground as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.95,0:09:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们安全带到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}for getting them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.31,0:09:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他能缓过来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think he'll come back from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.07,0:09:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你缓过来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.37,0:10:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是继续向前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.05,0:10:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们了结这一切后会更难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be harder after we finish this,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一切都平静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.69,0:10:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要尼根死了就不会更难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if Negan's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少对我而言不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for me, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我而言也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for me, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看这个 小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of this, D?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个啊 我们这趟小旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}This. Our little road trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,了结一切的机会 没什么不对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Opportunity to close. Nothing wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.74,0:11:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, D.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,说点真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's rap here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦率一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get candid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.67,0:11:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没别人 只有我俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nobody here but us chickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.79,0:11:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个头目之间的对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top guy to top guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道 按照你的分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to know if, in your analysis,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得在我们做了这么多 再加上\N{\fnArial\fs30}you believe these people are gonna cower and cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次警告之后 这群人真的会退缩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}after we deliver what amounts to yet another warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.69,0:12:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不是被请来动脑子的 - 非也\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't get paid to think. - ‭Not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,非也\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常看重你的看法 德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I value ‭your perspective, Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,正反[烙铁]两面你都熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been ‭on both sides of the iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.53,0:12:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不打算回答的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ‭if you're not gonna answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我来随便表达一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me extemporaneously express.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑这次行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I have my doubts this little maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.57,0:12:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否真能达到我们想要的效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}is going to deliver the desired outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们应该换种做法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we should do it different?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.42,0:12:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照老大的计划进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big man's plan will get it done,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.61,0:12:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've thrown a lot at Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,寡妇 国王整得很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}the widow, the King,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是不放弃 一直反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they just keep coming, keep fighting…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了 我也看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've seen it, I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我看到的都是同一个答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tallying it up, ‭I keep seeing the same answer…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.33,0:13:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}they don't scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如果你用食物或唱片填满箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If you fill the crates with food or phonograph records,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.11,0:13:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意换给你通向未来的钥匙「\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will gladly exchange them for a key to your future"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面列出了会面的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It lists coordinates for our meeting spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们宁愿轰开大门 出风头\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd blow ‭through the gates, make a big show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,作风不符\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.21,0:13:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是他们 我也不会惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't put nothin' past them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.85,0:13:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是陷阱 也太明显了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it is a trap, it's kind of obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.04,0:13:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才更可能是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is ‭what could make it a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.85,0:13:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一真有人想帮我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's someone who actually wants to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.87,0:14:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人想帮我们 我们错过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If someone is trying to help us and we miss out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.35,0:14:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就错过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we miss out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可如果有人要害我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If somebody's trying to kill us,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,多加小心就不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we're careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,多加小心就别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being careful is staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.49,0:14:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.82,0:14:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去看个究竟 - 你去我就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll see what's up. - You go, I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克希望我们待在这 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick wants us here. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但上一次我们像这样碰运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the last time ‭we took a chance like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就改变了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}it changed everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.78,0:14:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克那时不同意我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick didn't agree with me then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.05,0:14:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在或许也不会理解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may not understand me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最终他会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But eventually, he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣和其他人一直在外搜刮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus and the others have been scavenging,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.45,0:14:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们依然在挨饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're still starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这人确实能帮到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this person does have something that can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿些唱片 以备是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll grab records, case this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多带些弹夹 以备是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get extra clips in case it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.68,0:14:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他们来了 请鸣笛\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you see 'em coming, hit your horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll start the handoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,按计划来 不要掺和进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick to the plan, don't engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.23,0:16:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是尼根的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Negan's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.85,0:16:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.81,0:16:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到了吗 - 嗯 有人狠狠撞了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see it? - Yeah, someone pegged him…pegged him good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.31,0:16:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来似乎只有一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looked like just one guy, from what I could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到他朝哪边开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone see which way he went?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们安静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell them to pipe down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay icy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还埋伏着更多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}May be more of them out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持警戒 观察道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep guards up, scan your lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could have company.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.55,0:16:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没计划不能出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}No runnin' off without a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.07,0:17:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根的车被另一辆车撞出主路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car hit Negan's, pushed him off the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.44,0:17:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们朝那边去了 不可能走太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}They headed that way. Couldn't have gotten far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们还等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个开车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just one driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根自己可以搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing Negan can't handle on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.01,0:17:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为了以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just in case,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,德怀特和我会去查看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwight and I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 我们可以当后援 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, ‭we can back you up and… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.39,0:17:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是分散我们兵力的阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might be a ploy to divide our forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.06,0:17:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会让他们得逞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're not gonna let that happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是我们这么接近成功的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}not when we're so close to the master stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.59,0:17:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把货车转了向 确保没人从这边过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned my truck to make sure no one comes in this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,加里 我要你把那边也堵上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gary, I want you to do the same down that end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚起大家 守好周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep everyone in tight, create a perimeter,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.49,0:17:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰掉任何试图靠近的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}cut down anything that comes close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找大恩人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we locate our benefactor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}刘易斯医药用品店
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.82,0:19:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}别进来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.78,0:19:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}地下室[划掉]\N进入之人 必死无疑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.58,0:19:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are out of bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.41,0:19:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucille!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.83,0:20:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.52,0:21:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫乔吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Georgie,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.49,0:21:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两位是我的朋友 希尔达和米琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and these are my friends, Hilda and Midge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}But curious enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道我会拿什么换食物和音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see what I have to offer for food and music.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确希望这些唱片是音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do hope the records are music.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不接受只讲话的唱片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't accept spoken word.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.99,0:21:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're out here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.49,0:21:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明你们能照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know you can take care of yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.15,0:21:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无意与弱者分享这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care to share this with the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.92,0:21:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.03,0:22:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}None for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.66,0:22:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的东西给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us what you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.11,0:22:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来用知识做交换的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come bearing knowledge to trade …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.14,0:22:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来必要的知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}essential knowledge for the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要在我头脑里\N{\fnArial\fs30}primarily in my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.73,0:22:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我的头脑最好留在肩上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, I prefer ‭to keep that where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要用知识交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trading knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.71,0:22:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.87,0:22:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前也和别人做过这样的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made the same offer before …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.76,0:22:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,装满箱子 给你知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}fill the crates, get the knowledge …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是什么把戏 只是公平的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a trick, just a fair trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.49,0:22:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是善意之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an act of benevolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我还能怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.33,0:22:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.39,0:22:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的东西和交易无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what's in there isn't part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.40,0:22:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.79,0:23:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了多少团体\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many communities have you found?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.63,0:23:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你们这样的团体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Communities like yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.31,0:23:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not many at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.82,0:23:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久没遇到过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not one for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所拥有的非常特别 罕见\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you have is special, unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.05,0:23:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,亡者激发了我们最好和最坏的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead have brought out our best and worst,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.21,0:23:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,近来最坏的一面盖过了最好的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the worst has been outpacing the best lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.58,0:23:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不会持续太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that won't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.53,0:23:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.78,0:23:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果人们能再次互相相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}If, perhaps, people can believe in people again,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.00,0:23:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,四箱补给的价值远不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}four crates of goods is worth far less.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个可持续的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}than a sustainable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.92,0:23:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及一种相互的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}and perhaps an exercise in trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.00,0:23:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.61,0:23:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在「信任」听上去像是一个编出来的词\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Trust" Probably sounds like a made-up word now,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.48,0:23:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像叽里咕噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}like flibberschticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.41,0:23:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者故里呱啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or klompf.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.21,0:23:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或湿润\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.10,0:23:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.57,0:23:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.73,0:23:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人做你们所说的事还能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way anyone survives going around ‭doing what you say you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:23:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.93,0:24:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会继续活下去 因为我能看出\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will, because I can divine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.91,0:24:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是个很好的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you are a fine group,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.35,0:24:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了有点没礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}manners notwithstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.28,0:24:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.77,0:24:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.38,0:24:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些人还有她们的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people and their van.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.27,0:24:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部带回山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}are coming with us back to Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.99,0:24:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.11,0:24:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,老子是九命猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a goddamn cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.28,0:24:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.39,0:25:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where's your people?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.15,0:25:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会儿应该到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should be here by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.78,0:25:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没走多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't get that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.52,0:25:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.31,0:25:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This I where you die…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.94,0:25:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,被黑暗包围 无比孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the dark, all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.33,0:25:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底有什么毛病 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is your problem, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.50,0:25:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你现在经历着很多痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I know you're working through some shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.19,0:25:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以忍受的痛苦 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}the worst kind of shit, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.94,0:25:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你绝对是我这辈子见过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you aren't the most stubborn know-it-all prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.06,0:25:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,最固执最自负的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've ever crossed dicks with…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.06,0:25:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不让我救你 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just let me save you, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.09,0:25:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很擅长的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.83,0:25:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了救世堂 哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved everybody in the Sanctuary,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.37,0:25:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,山顶寨 神之国所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Outpost, Hilltop, Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.97,0:25:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了他们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.38,0:25:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their kids…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.26,0:25:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够安全地长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}…can grow up safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.66,0:25:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接管之后 他们没有任何伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't lose one after we took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.64,0:26:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.70,0:26:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在瑞克·格兰姆斯到来前都过得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}were doing just fine before Rick Grimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.30,0:26:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}噬肉者
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.05,0:26:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不只是辜负了你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've not only failed your boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.04,0:26:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还辜负了你的子民 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}you failed your people, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.09,0:26:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想一想都觉得难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of makes me sick just thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.96,0:26:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,浪费了那么多潜能\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that wasted potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.58,0:26:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, see, ‭there is still hope for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.35,0:26:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意跟你做个一次性的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}A one-time deal that I will make.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.43,0:26:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了纪念你霸气的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the memory of your bad-ass son,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.45,0:26:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我真正佩服的人致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone that I actually respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.33,0:27:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你劝山顶寨 神之国 亚历山大臣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get Hilltop, Kingdom, Alexandria to fall in line,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.07,0:27:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就恢复如常\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our arrangement is back in place,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.36,0:27:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就原谅你 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you are forgiven, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把提成从50%降到25%\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will lower my take from 50% to 25%,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅25%而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lousy 25%.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.43,0:27:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你 你要来给我干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, ‭you got to come work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.95,0:27:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,从清洁工做起 完全不算差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janitorial to start, not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.21,0:27:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的子民 他们能活得像75%的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people, they get to live like 75% kings!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.35,0:27:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 我摆在你面前的可是一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that is an epic freakin' Christmas-Hanukah-Kwanzaa gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.38,0:27:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,肥得流油的节日大礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}all rolled up into one,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.52,0:27:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟你一直以来给我找了那么多麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering what a thorn in my ass cheek you've all been.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.63,0:27:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对简迪斯的人做了那样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why would I trust any deal offered to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.76,0:27:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么还要相信你的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}after what you did to Jadis' people?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.88,0:27:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.91,0:27:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些拾荒者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Scavengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.36,0:27:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他们 一个不留\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed them … all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.35,0:27:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个社区被血洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole community just wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.40,0:28:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是那样「救人」的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that how you "Save" people?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.41,0:28:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.78,0:28:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然只有我和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still just me and you…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.05,0:28:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然很多你的人肯定看到你走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though plenty of your people must've seen you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.64,0:28:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 就是在这种时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}See … See, it's times like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.45,0:28:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才会明白谁才是真正的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}you realize ‭who your true friends are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.82,0:28:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会来救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.53,0:28:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must've thought about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.23,0:28:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲手干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}clipping him yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.58,0:29:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指他霸占我老婆的时候吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean when he took my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.80,0:29:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者烧焦我脸的时候吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or burned my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.78,0:29:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.95,0:29:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never thought about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.26,0:29:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not once.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.89,0:29:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没那样做是因为你选择了生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't ‭because you chose to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.53,0:29:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是纠结于过去的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of focusing on past discomforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.33,0:29:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.71,0:29:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了想要活下来必须做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did what you had to to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.14,0:29:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们的老大并没有这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet our leader is not doing the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.63,0:29:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was my call…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.54,0:29:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就到此为止吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd say enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.96,0:29:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会扩展领域 找新地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd branch out, we'd find new places,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.98,0:29:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立新关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd make new relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.14,0:29:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会确保救世军活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd make sure the Saviors survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.25,0:29:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你的选择一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you chose to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.16,0:29:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会从过去的痛苦中走出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'd move on ‭from past discomforts as you…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.88,0:29:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你明智的选择一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}wisely chose to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.56,0:30:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我都说开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.82,0:30:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋蛋敞开吹着冷风\N{\fnArial\fs30}my nuts blowin' in the breeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.75,0:30:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,赤裸裸地站在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}naked as a jaybird.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.74,0:30:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.54,0:30:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么过去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.13,0:30:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.27,0:31:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是他的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be his.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.27,0:31:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是他带的那个桶里的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the bucket he brought with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.85,0:31:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能在任何地方 活着或者死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be anywhere, alive or dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.63,0:31:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,半死不活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.33,0:31:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just 'cause he walked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.44,0:31:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不代表还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean he's breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.63,0:31:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以继续找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can keep looking,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.05,0:31:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许找到他的时候还算是活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe find him more alive than dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.91,0:31:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.41,0:31:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要面对一个讨厌的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could face a distasteful moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.89,0:31:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们可以走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we could walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.87,0:31:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去找我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.52,0:31:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让事情变得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make things even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.33,0:31:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是历史性的一刻 德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a critical point in our history, Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.68,0:32:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们以后可以告诉子孙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is something we could tell our grandkids about.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.02,0:32:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.39,0:33:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,接力鸣笛响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The handoff horn started up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.56,0:33:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有确认的袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no confirmation hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.42,0:33:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军可能放慢速度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saviors could've slowed their roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.37,0:33:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,随他们 我们会进一步拖住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let 'em. ‭We'll slow 'em down more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.77,0:33:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.11,0:33:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就天黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be dark soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.53,0:33:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get people ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.88,0:33:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.45,0:33:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该抓紧交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should make the deal and let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.26,0:33:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在救世军来之前放她们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the Saviors get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.44,0:33:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let her go,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.63,0:33:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让她们带着物资走\N{\fnArial\fs30}not with what they have.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.43,0:33:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多张嘴需要喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got too many mouths to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.46,0:33:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们车里有很多食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have quite foods in that van.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.01,0:33:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人很快就会挨饿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People here could be starving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.23,0:33:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.26,0:34:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们夺走她们的物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take their stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.27,0:34:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然其他人也会夺走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, someone else will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.19,0:34:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人会杀了她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone else will kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.98,0:34:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们能活到现在已经是个奇迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a miracle ‭they're still alive, anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.57,0:34:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军在路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors are on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.54,0:34:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会战斗 会死一些自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna fight, and some of us will die,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.46,0:34:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以何必在乎那些不自爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so why should we give a shit about people who don't give a shit about themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.43,0:34:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 在外面像那样生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, out there, living like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.83,0:34:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们夺走她们的东西并使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take their stuff, and we use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.99,0:34:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再假装一切会好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stop pretending ‭that things just work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.63,0:34:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.10,0:34:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔救了西迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl rescued Siddiq,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.25,0:34:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们有了一个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now we have doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.29,0:34:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.77,0:34:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔很勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl was brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.87,0:34:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.78,0:34:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.10,0:35:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情不会自己好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things don't just work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.10,0:35:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.14,0:35:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.52,0:35:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想他知道这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think he knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.37,0:35:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有放弃成为瑞克想让他成为的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't give up ‭on who Rick wanted him to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.76,0:35:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不能放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.22,0:35:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为卡尔想让我们成为的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}on who he wanted us to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.22,0:35:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.34,0:36:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的那一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you have…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.50,0:36:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不可能长久\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, that was never gonna last.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.43,0:36:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.79,0:36:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会遇到像我一样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were gonna meet someone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.90,0:36:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.53,0:36:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,或我的人 甚至是你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or my people or even yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.78,0:36:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你谁也救不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.32,0:36:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你谁也不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you don't care about anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.70,0:36:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你利用人们 喂你吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You use people to bring food…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.27,0:36:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪你睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sleep with you…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.41,0:36:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.75,0:36:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唯一在乎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing you care about…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.69,0:36:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这球棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}is this bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.69,0:36:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你连它都救不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't even save that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.74,0:36:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来跟你谈个交易吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.21,0:36:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我允许你和它吻别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you kiss her goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.93,0:36:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准碰它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you touch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.99,0:37:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来拿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.26,0:37:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.68,0:37:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands off of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.42,0:37:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn psychopath…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.99,0:37:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会害死我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna kill us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.65,0:37:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你先死就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long as it's you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.73,0:39:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是讲话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No spoken word?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.13,0:39:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意你的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm agreeing to your deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.86,0:39:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给你装满四箱 然后让你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll fill your four crates, then you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.96,0:39:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好早走点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna want that to be sooner than later.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.04,0:39:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.12,0:39:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要改变条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm changing the terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.68,0:39:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one, no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.52,0:39:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,此外\N{\fnArial\fs30}In addition,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.81,0:39:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以拿走我一大部分的食物储备\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can have a sizeable portion of my food stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.03,0:39:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里的情况来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the looks of things around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.39,0:39:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们比我们更需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need it far more than we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.46,0:39:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要给我们食物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're giving us food?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.84,0:39:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,换什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.20,0:39:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱片和信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Records and good faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.04,0:39:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,澄清一下 这不是礼物 这是交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be clear, this isn't a gift, it's barter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.00,0:39:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.09,0:39:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不会很快 但我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not for a while, but I will,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.18,0:39:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了那时 我期望看到伟大的成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by then, I expect great things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.33,0:39:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.50,0:39:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是之前提到的通向未来的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the aforementioned key to a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.42,0:40:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,内有手写计划 包括风车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside, there are ‭handwritten plans for windmills,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.87,0:40:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,水磨 筒仓 手绘原理图\N{\fnArial\fs30}watermills, silos, hand-drawn schematics,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.60,0:40:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,细粮 木材 沟渠制作指南\N{\fnArial\fs30}guides to refining grain, creating lumber, aqueducts …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.78,0:40:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一部中世纪人类成就之书\N{\fnArial\fs30}a book ‭of medieval human achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.84,0:40:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们用过去创造未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we may have a future from our past.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.59,0:40:19.76,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}《通向未来的钥匙》\N早期文明至今的机械 技术\N任务 劳作 解决方法指南\N一条从过去走向更先进未来的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.96,0:40:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道 原版在我脑海中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know, ‭the originals are in my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.19,0:40:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我做了拷贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I made photocopies.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.69,0:40:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过自从做好之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, it's been an evolving document.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.18,0:40:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在改动更新\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the copy shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.73,0:40:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.29,0:40:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,建好这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Build this place up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.06,0:40:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我回来时 要把其他几箱装满\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want those other crates filled when I get back …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.79,0:40:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给希尔达的奶酪 给米琪的腌菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}cheeses for Hilda, pickles for Midge.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.61,0:40:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会尽力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see what we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.92,0:40:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.69,0:41:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了娜塔尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed Natania.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.92,0:41:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在外面试图杀死碰见的任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was out there trying to kill anyone she came across,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.63,0:41:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们碰见了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we came across her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.21,0:41:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了她 所以我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I killed her, and I'm alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.51,0:41:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔救了某人 所以他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Carl saved someone, and he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.65,0:41:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell ‭are we supposed to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.76,0:41:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道要停止战斗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we supposed to just stop fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.40,0:41:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得卡尔不想让我们停止为了未来而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think Carl wanted us to stop fighting for our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.32,0:42:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得他想告诉我们 要想有未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think he was telling us that, to get to our future,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.77,0:42:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,光靠战斗是不够的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's gonna take ‭more than just fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.13,0:42:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军正在来这里的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors are coming right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.45,0:42:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会与他们战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.46,0:42:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但未来一定不只如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's gotta be something after.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.31,0:42:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没和他们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.06,0:42:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.48,0:42:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.40,0:42:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找不到他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.60,0:42:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.52,0:42:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.65,0:42:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.80,0:42:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.89,0:42:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.59,0:43:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.47,0:43:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.60,0:43:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Negan!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.00,0:43:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.35,0:43:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all are!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.91,0:43:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大在不在无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't matter ‭if the big man ain't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.20,0:43:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们依然是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.69,0:43:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道他是不是真死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know if he's "Gone" Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.11,0:43:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他依然很有可能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could very well be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.48,0:43:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的计划 尼根的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our plan … Negan's plan …
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.01,0:43:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是去山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}was to go on to Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.69,0:43:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那些人的心中埋下恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put the fear of God in these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.89,0:43:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们终于任我们摆布\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that, finally, once and for all, they get with the program.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.41,0:43:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在刚发生过的事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after what just happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.99,0:43:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们那样对尼根之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}what they did to Negan,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.09,0:44:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为他们无法领会我们的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}that tells me that what we need from them is beyond them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.09,0:44:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候接受这点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time we come to accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.34,0:44:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受以后 一切都豁然开朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once we do, it'll become crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.46,0:44:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有一件事可做\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's only one thing left for us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.64,0:44:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须清洗他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must expunge them.
